{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"InnoRouter models a running flow as a single value ("},{"code":"FlowPlan<R>","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" \/"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"RouteStack<R>","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"). When both the routes ("},{"code":"R","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") and the containing types","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Codable"},{"type":"text","text":", the entire state can round-trip through JSON. That is"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"enough for state restoration, deep-link payloads, and offline replay."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"StatePersistence<R>"},{"type":"text","text":" bundles a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"JSONEncoder"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"JSONDecoder"},{"text":" so","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"call sites don’t have to redeclare them:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift skip doc-fragment","code":["let persistence = StatePersistence<AppRoute>()","","\/\/ At checkpoint time (e.g. scene will deactivate):","let plan = try FlowPlan(validating: flowStore.path)","let data = try persistence.encode(plan)","try data.write(to: restorationURL, options: .atomic)","","\/\/ At launch time:","if let data = try? Data(contentsOf: restorationURL) {","    let restored = try persistence.decode(data)","    flowStore.apply(restored)","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"SwiftUI apps can wrap the value-level helper with"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"StateRestorationAdapter"},{"text":" from ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"InnoRouterSwiftUI"},{"text":":","type":"text"}]},{"code":["let adapter = StateRestorationAdapter<AppRoute> { failure in","    diagnostics.record(failure)","}","","try adapter.snapshotNavigationStack(from: navigationStore)","_ = adapter.restoreFlowPlan(from: data, into: flowStore)"],"syntax":"swift skip doc-fragment","type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The adapter supports navigation-stack and flow-plan snapshots. Decode"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or apply failures are reported through the restoration failure callback"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and leave the existing store state untouched instead of falling back to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"an empty path."}]},{"anchor":"Validation-on-decode","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Validation on decode"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FlowPlan"},{"type":"text","text":" always satisfies the FlowStore invariants:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"At most one modal step.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A modal step only at the tail of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"steps"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All other steps are "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".push"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FlowPlan(validating:)"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FlowPlan.validate(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" enforce these"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"invariants up front and throw "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FlowPlanValidationError"},{"type":"text","text":" on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"violation. Codable decode runs the same validator and converts a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"violation into "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DecodingError.dataCorruptedError"},{"type":"text","text":", so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FlowPlan"},{"text":" round-tripped through disk or network can no longer","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"silently produce a value that ","type":"text"},{"code":"apply(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" will reject later. If","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the snapshot format on disk drifts (older builds, hand-edited","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"JSON, schema migration mid-flight), the decode call surfaces the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"error at restoration time — not at the next user action."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The permissive "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FlowPlan(steps:)"},{"type":"text","text":" initializer remains available"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"for internal builders that already trust the origin of ","type":"text"},{"code":"steps","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Scope","type":"heading","anchor":"Scope"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The helper intentionally covers only the typed "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Data ↔ value"},{"type":"text","text":" bridge."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Out of scope, by design:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Where the encoded bytes live (","type":"text"},{"code":"UserDefaults","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", a file URL, iCloud,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a database) — that is app policy.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"When snapshots are taken — tie the call into ","type":"text"},{"code":"ScenePhase","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"UIScene","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" lifecycle, or a custom trigger.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Version-aware migration from older snapshot formats — add a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"wrapper struct around ","type":"text"},{"code":"FlowPlan","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" if the underlying routes evolve.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Selective field redaction — encode only the fragments the app is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"willing to persist.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"level":2,"text":"Customising the encoder","type":"heading","anchor":"Customising-the-encoder"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Any ","type":"text"},{"code":"JSONEncoder","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"JSONDecoder","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" are acceptable inputs. Pass a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"preconfigured pair to the initializer for deterministic output, date","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"strategies, or custom key coding:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let encoder = JSONEncoder()","encoder.outputFormatting = [.sortedKeys, .prettyPrinted]","","let decoder = JSONDecoder()","decoder.dateDecodingStrategy = .iso8601","","let persistence = StatePersistence<AppRoute>(encoder: encoder, decoder: decoder)"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift skip doc-fragment"},{"level":2,"text":"Error surface","type":"heading","anchor":"Error-surface"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Both ","type":"text"},{"code":"encode(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"decode(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" re-throw the underlying","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"EncodingError","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" \/ ","type":"text"},{"code":"DecodingError","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" so call sites keep the diagnostic","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"context needed to distinguish schema drift from I\/O failures.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"StatePersistence"},{"type":"text","text":" is a thin helper that serializes "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FlowPlan"},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RouteStack"},{"type":"text","text":" values to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Data"},{"type":"text","text":" for launch-time restoration. It deliberately"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stops at the value boundary so apps keep full control over where — and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when — snapshots are written."}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.core\/documentation\/InnoRouterCore\/Tutorial-StatePersistence","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"title":"State Persistence and Restoration","roleHeading":"Article","modules":[{"name":"InnoRouterTesting"}],"role":"article"},"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/innoroutercore\/tutorial-statepersistence"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.core\/documentation\/InnoRouterTesting"],["doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.core\/documentation\/InnoRouterTesting","doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.core\/documentation\/InnoRouterCore\/InnoRouterCore"]]},"references":{"doc://com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.core/documentation/InnoRouterTesting":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.core\/documentation\/InnoRouterTesting","abstract":[],"title":"InnoRouterTesting","url":"\/documentation\/innoroutertesting","role":"collection"},"doc://com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.core/documentation/InnoRouterCore/InnoRouterCore":{"abstract":[{"text":"State, command, result, and execution primitives for InnoRouter.","type":"text"}],"title":"InnoRouterCore","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.core\/documentation\/InnoRouterCore\/InnoRouterCore","kind":"article","role":"collectionGroup","url":"\/documentation\/innoroutercore\/innoroutercore","type":"topic"}}}